Ballet[ 2] can be used as an introductory[ level] or one that builds on Creative, Pre-Ballet and Ballet 1. The concepts of locomotion, body awareness, pathways, dance vocabulary, sequencing ,musicality, and a strong emphasis on anatomy, core strength and the use of proper alignment are strongly taught at this[ level]. An 18[ week] curriculum is followed that bases each class on[ concepts] of movement, space or the body and how it functions. A rehearsal component is included in

