> For the month of April only: Receive Dermapen 4 Face &[ Neck] Treatment[ + An] Alginate Mask[ +] IonZyme Machine Treatment[ for] only R[1],[500 (]all inclusive).
We[ are] proud to launch the new Dermapen 4 at Natural Aesthetics[.] We[ were] the first clinic in South Africa to receive the Dermapen[ 4.] So what makes the Dermapen[ 4 so] much better than the Dermapen 3[ or any] other microneed[ling] device?
Dermapen 4 has a 16 needle cartridge instead of just 12 needles,[ reaching an] inflammatory response[ at] a much quicker rate.
The Dermapen[ 4 generates] 47.9% more micro-channels than Dermapen 3 and 104% more micro-channels than[ any] counterfeit device.
The Dermapen 4 generates 1,920 puncture channels per second, which means we can almost double the amount of serums[ and] actives that we[ needle into] the skin[ per] treatment, than before.
The additional 620 micro-channels makes the treatment[ much] quicker[ and more] comfortable than before.
Dermapen[ 4] is the only microneed[ling] device with a dedicated scar setting and protocols[ for revision] of deep, atrophic scars[; including] surgical[,] burn contract[ure], striae and post-ac[ne] scars.[ Need]le penetration can now[ be] increased up to[ 3].[0]mm.
AOVN technology, automatically calibr[ates] the motor[ speed], pressure and penetration[ for targeted precision].
The Dermapen 4[ is] safer than other microneed[ling] devices, no dragging or pulling of the skin.
Only Dermapen 4 features a unique, medical-grade silicone seal and fluid guard. The external cartridge is fortified with a specialised fluid guard that prevents cross contamination to the outer cartridge shell. Safety First!
Specialised retention valves relieve the build-up of procedural pressure within the Dermapen 4 needle cartridge. The effect prevents fluid build-up within the needle cavity. The vacuum-like sensation removes the risk of cross contamination whilst ensuring pressure-free contact to the skin[ during] a procedure.
Top: Medical grade numbing cream applied for 20 – 30 minutes, we then needle medical grade serums and actives into the skin via the Dermapen 4 device. Bottom: An Alginate Mask is applied and connected to our IonZyme Machine. A medical grade concealer is applied to speed up recovery and cover any immediate post treatment red

