> Colette has extensive experience in the beauty industry and her passion and dedication ensure[ an] exceptional service to each[ and] every customer. Colette has the expertise to skillfully[ create] a[ truly] stunning[ look] for you[ for] your big day, prom or any special event where you really want to[ look a million dollars]!
